@startuml 15-modulith-event-publication
title Spring Modulith — transactional outbox + event publication

participant "Service A\n(Publisher)" as A
participant "ApplicationEventPublisher" as AEP
participant "EventPublicationRegistry\n(Modulith core)" as Reg
database "event_publication\ntable" as Outbox
participant "Modulith Event Loop\n(scheduler / sync invoker)" as Loop
participant "Service B\n(@ApplicationModuleListener)" as B
participant "Service C\n(@ApplicationModuleListener)" as Cc

== Faza 1: Publikacja w ramach głównej transakcji ==

A -> AEP: publishEvent(SomeDomainEvent)
activate AEP

AEP -> Reg: capture listeners that will handle this event
note over Reg #LightBlue: Modulith zna wszystkie\n@ApplicationModuleListener metody\n(skanuje przy starcie)

AEP -> Outbox: INSERT event_publication\n(id, event_type, listener_id,\n serialized_event,\n publication_date, completion_date=NULL)
note over Outbox: Jeden insert PER listener\n(np. 2 listenery = 2 wiersze)

AEP --> A: return
deactivate AEP

A -> A: ... reszta kodu ...
note over A #LightBlue: TRANSAKCJA SIĘ KOŃCZY:\nlub COMMIT (everything saved including events)\nlub ROLLBACK (also events not persisted)\nAtomicity: domain change + event NIGDY się nie rozjeżdżają

== Faza 2: Po commicie — wywołanie listenerów ==

note over Loop #LightBlue: AfterCommit: Modulith odpala\nlistenerów dla świeżo zapisanych eventów

Loop -> Outbox: SELECT * WHERE completion_date IS NULL\nORDER BY publication_date
Outbox --> Loop: List<EventPublication>

loop dla każdego publication
  alt @ApplicationModuleListener @Async
    Loop ->> B: onSomeEvent(event)\n(osobny wątek z TaskDecorator)
    activate B
    note over B #LightBlue: TenantAwareTaskDecorator:\nrestore TenantContext + MDC\nz wątku który publikował
    B -> B: handle (long-running task,\nnp. indexowanie OpenAI)
    B -> Loop: callback: completed
    deactivate B
  else synchronous listener
    Loop -> Cc: onSomeEvent(event)
    activate Cc
    Cc -> Cc: handle
    Cc --> Loop: return
    deactivate Cc
  end

  Loop -> Outbox: UPDATE event_publication\nSET completion_date = NOW()\nWHERE id = ?
end

note over Outbox: completion_date != NULL\n→ event obsłużony,\nnie zostanie ponowiony

== Failure recovery ==

note over Loop #LightPink: Jeśli listener rzuci wyjątek:\n→ completion_date pozostaje NULL\n→ przy NASTĘPNYM starcie aplikacji\n   (events.republish-outstanding-on-restart=true)\n   Modulith odpala go ponownie

== Use cases w Multibocie ==

note over A #LightYellow: Konkretne flows:\n• DocumentService.upload()\n  → DocumentUploadedEvent\n  → IndexingService.onDocumentUploaded (async)\n\n• IndexingService po skończeniu\n  → IndexingCompletedEvent\n  → DocumentStatusUpdater.onIndexingCompleted (sync)\n\n• DocumentService.delete()\n  → DocumentDeletedEvent\n  → (na razie nikt nie słucha, gotowe na audit/analytics)

@enduml
